WEBVTT

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.200
The cavalry's not coming.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.816
There is no big rescue,

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.216
no prince charming,

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:07.056
no big bailout in the works.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:12.336
To have a shot at something other
than being old and poor in America,

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:16.160
we're going to have to save
ourselves and each other.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:21.080
I've had to come out of the shadows,

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:25.936
stand here openly,

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.936
and I'm inviting you to do so as well.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:32.216
I'm not going to tell you
that it's not easy.